00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:19.280
In Russian, describing words, we call them adjectives, are like chameleans.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.100
They gently change their ending to match the animal they're describing.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.820
