00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.880
Next time you see honey or taste med.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.060
That's the Russian word for honey.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:55.980
Remember it is cousins with the Russian bear.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:02.940
That sweet golden connection is your secret shortcut to remembering medved forever.

